OL,3,AHelpful but awkward: My week with
OL,4,AMeta's Muse ahead of its UK launch
OL,5,
OL,6,FI've just spent a week using Muse,
OL,7,FMeta's AI agent that rolls out in the
OL,8,FUK today.
OL,10,FAgents are systems that don't just
OL,11,Frespond to questions but can carry out
OL,12,Ftasks for you. With Muse, Meta gives
OL,13,Fthe examples of "searching for a
OL,14,Fcheaper energy deal" or "sorting the
OL,15,Fschool calendar."
OL,17,FAnd it's true that it has helped me run
OL,18,Fmy life - but it also challenged my
OL,19,Fpersonal privacy boundaries, and made
OL,20,Fme endure some cringeworthy
OL,21,Finteractions.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
