OL,3,ABros announce first tour in a decade
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe band Bros have announced their
OL,6,Ffirst tour in a decade.
OL,8,FFormed in Camberley, Surrey, in 1986 by
OL,9,Ftwin brothers Matt and Luke Goss
OL,10,Falongside Craig Logan, the band had
OL,11,Fhits including When Will I Be Famous?,
OL,12,FDrop The Boy and I Owe You Nothing.
OL,14,FLogan left in 1989 and Bros split three
OL,15,Fyears later, although Matt and Luke
OL,16,FGoss reunited in 2017 and have not
OL,17,Ftoured together since.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
