OL,3,ABros announce first tour in a decade
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe 10-date tour in 2027 will include a
OL,6,FWembley Arena show, 38 years after Bros
OL,7,Fplayed to 77,000 fans at Wembley
OL,8,FStadium, where they became the youngest
OL,9,Fact to headline the venue at the age of
OL,10,F20.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
